e $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ and $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})=\\frac{1}{2}$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =4\\sqrt{3}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})) \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{3}(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\text{i}\\,\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\cdot 3}{2}+\\text{i}\\,\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =6+2\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284591 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284592 13194139534372 true] [17592186284591 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284593 13194139534372 true] [17592186284591 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534372 true] [17592186284591 1041 "field-1" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284591 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284592 13194139534372 true] [17592186284591 1110 #uuid "e2b41941-0024-56e4-9847-a4d0a01b2f69" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284592 1034 "6" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284592 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534372 true] [17592186284592 1111 #uuid "d7eceab0-366b-5776-ab2a-115d4cdb6162" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284593 1034 "4" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284593 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534372 true] [17592186284593 1111 #uuid "af181426-9835-52ee-b01d-f5cdd212b398" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284594 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284595 13194139534372 true] [17592186284594 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534372 true] [17592186284594 1041 "field-2" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284594 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284595 13194139534372 true] [17592186284594 1110 #uuid "63d2046d-a7fa-55d1-99de-e8a1d49cb1e9" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284595 1034 "2\\sqrt{3}" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284595 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534372 true] [17592186284595 1111 #uuid "5c570236-afba-59b3-9c45-f33456ab1432" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284596 1017 #edb/ref 17592186284597 13194139534372 true] [17592186284596 1017 #edb/ref 17592186284599 13194139534372 true] [17592186284596 1017 #edb/ref 17592186284601 13194139534372 true] [17592186284596 1089 "q-321385" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284596 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534372 true] [17592186284596 1100 "Express $z=\\frac{9}{5+2\\text{i}}$ in the form $r(\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ).$ Give the **exact** value of $r$ and round $\\theta $ in **radians** from $[0,2\\pi )$ to **two decimal places**.\n\n$z=$\n{{field-1}}$\\cdot (cos$\n$(${{field-2}}$)$\n$+\\,isin$\n$(${{field-3}}$))$" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284596 1113 #uuid "611bc47f-782a-5d17-b6c5-83149097d2d2" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284596 1145 "First, we express the given complex number in the form $z=x+y\\text{i}.$ To do this, we remove $\\text{i}$ from the denominator by multiplying the numerator and denominator of $z$ by the complex conjugate of the denominator, which is $5-2\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =\\frac{9}{5+2\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{9(5-2\\text{i})}{(5+2\\text{i})(5-2\\text{i})} \\\\  & =\\frac{45-18\\text{i}}{{5}^{2}-(2\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{45-18\\text{i}}{{5}^{2}+(2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{45-18\\text{i}}{29} \\\\  & =\\frac{45}{29}-\\frac{18}{29}\\,i\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn polar form, $r$ represents the magnitude $|z|.$ For a complex number $z=x+y\\text{i},$ the magnitude of $z$ is given by\n\n$$\n|z|=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nSo, for $z=\\frac{45}{29}-\\frac{18}{29}\\,i,$ the magnitude is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{45}{29})}^{2}+{(\\frac{18}{29})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{2025+324}{{29}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2349}}{29} \\\\  & =\\frac{9\\sqrt{29}}{29}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn polar form, $\\theta $  represents the argument $\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z).$ Since $x=\\frac{45}{29}$ and $y=-\\frac{18}{29},$ $z$ lies in the fourth quadrant. So, we can find $\\theta $ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =2\\pi -arctan\\,(\\frac{|y|}{x}) \\\\  & =2\\pi -arctan\\,(\\frac{18}{45}) \\\\  & ≈5.90\\,,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to two decimal places.\n\nFinally, we write the complex number $z$ in polar form:\n\n$$\nz=\\frac{9\\sqrt{29}}{29}\\cdot \\,(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5.90)+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5.90)).\n$$" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284597 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284598 13194139534372 true] [17592186284597 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534372 true] [17592186284597 1041 "field-1" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284597 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284598 13194139534372 true] [17592186284597 1110 #uuid "3224b6c9-4e6c-5176-a81f-f4c0a3394212" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284598 1034 "\\frac{9\\sqrt{29}}{29}" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284598 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534372 true] [17592186284598 1111 #uuid "edf8a1bb-9f7f-5d3c-b555-34f1ea0f13f1" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284599 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284600 13194139534372 true] [17592186284599 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534372 true] [17592186284599 1041 "field-2" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284599 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284600 13194139534372 true] [17592186284599 1110 #uuid "176e374e-a7f5-5ad4-bf8f-62395fc31a68" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284600 1034 "5.90" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284600 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534372 true] [17592186284600 1111 #uuid "9ddff1ae-8e6e-58ca-ba23-402c232aef67" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284601 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284602 13194139534372 true] [17592186284601 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534372 true] [17592186284601 1041 "field-3" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284601 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284602 13194139534372 true] [17592186284601 1110 #uuid "2bba3519-9ab5-5b03-acf5-8d03c26af76a" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284602 1034 "5.90" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284602 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534372 true] [17592186284602 1111 #uuid "1915e1a7-dd8e-56ce-9524-3a255c2f2383" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284603 1017 #edb/ref 17592186284604 13194139534372 true] [17592186284603 1089 "q-69966" 13194139534372 true] [17592186284603 1091 #edb/ref